## Project Architecture

- `assets/app-schema.json`: Machine-readable domain metadata exported from Case2Code.
- `lib/config/app_schema.dart`: Compiled metadata descriptors for entities, fields, foreign keys, and `1:N` child collections.
- `lib/models/`: Strongly-typed Dart domain classes with `fromJson` and `toJson` serialization:
{% for entity in entities %}
  - `lib/models/{{ entity.snake_name }}.dart` (`{{ entity.name }}`)
{% endfor %}
- `lib/services/api_service.dart`: REST HTTP client for CRUD operations, relational queries, and the NLP Business Assistant.
- `lib/screens/`:
  - `home_screen.dart`: Adaptive dashboard and navigation drawer across all domain entities.
  - `entity_list_screen.dart`: Searchable, refreshable list with delete confirmation.
  - `entity_detail_screen.dart`: Master-detail view displaying record attributes and related `1:N` child collections.
  - `entity_form_screen.dart`: Dynamic type-aware form with date/time pickers, boolean switches, and foreign key dropdown selectors.
  - `assistant_screen.dart`: Natural language Business Assistant chat connected to `POST /api/assistant/execute`.
